{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"MU"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"MU"},2],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"稳定同伦论","text":"稳定同伦论"}}]},4],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>$MU$ 是复向量丛的万有 "},{"Local":{"url":"Thom谱","text":"Thom 谱"}},{"Plain":", 它表示了复配边上同调理论. $MU$ 是 "},{"Local":{"url":"MO","text":"MO"}},{"Plain":" 的类比.</p>\n<p>作为"},{"Local":{"url":"序列谱","text":"序列谱"}},{"Plain":", $MU$ 的第 $2k$ 项为万有 $k$ 阶复向量丛的 Thom 谱.</p>\n<h2>复配边上同调理论</h2>\n<p>对于空间 $X$, $\\mathrm {MU}^*(X)$ 是 $X$ 上一种流形的配边 (bordism) 类, 其稳定法丛上带有近复结构.</p>\n"}]}}